Z||000001||Mach10||11-11-2001||06:01 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by mark's 86:<BR><B>im trying to put my ddip stick back in its place i was wondering if there was an easier way to get it back in the hole i took it out by accident and now cant get the damn thing back in i have a v6 any help please would be greatly appericated cause i keep mising the hole....</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Normally, I WOULD laugh, but I have tried to check my oil at night... Not fun   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Sorry dude, get your hands dirty, get the tip in, and sorta twist it in... You'll have to twist it back and forth as it goes in...<P>Wow, that sounds exceedingly NASTY  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>||||reg||10
