Z||000006||avengador1||11-11-2001||08:00 PM||||Get someone to help you. while you are under the car you can use a mirror or might be able to see where it goes. It is between the oil filter and the starter motor. It's supposed to be screwed to the bracket bolted to the valve cover. I've included a picture if this helps. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero18.JPG"> <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Avendgador1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
